{
  "bundle_sha256": "7d8b4e95b8b0b5f7a23ef9dcff0a3ebe6655eec9733a8e0d7b2489ef04bbe60e",
  "entries": [
    {
      "id": "1c8e68c80f1b9223671e3160e3a7a3261c9c4e507cd606c9ff6e08b8dcc51d78",
      "text": "第五盘一比六，他与冠军擦肩。法网亚军的一千三百分，是他本季最大的一笔单站积分。",
      "audio_sha256": "3e281fe221f1f80622f091e53a63970b27a651561f3632da9d6be171b36de628",
      "marks_sha256": "ac2bf306b52d15973e07b24adbe8bfa25554122dc42031d11ecf2494486bcadb"
    },
    {
      "id": "358d85b31a6f2fee3804626a15d40b58d7dc69115da5a498d94c87d16b3242ec",
      "text": "门票在场外落定，通往都灵的路，是他一场场打出来的。第一次年终，在意大利的主场球迷面前，他还能走多远？",
      "audio_sha256": "93372ed88b1c4471354364fe32c1daf0bee487f15a98011d25f80dcb6320ea4b",
      "marks_sha256": "16754e1adf1659a01dab2ef29d31c9d906d6840f0f22e82f97b5173ec589137b"
    },
    {
      "id": "47629469d1f796d3b62ff0e959bf99f50f8fbdfc3ccbde8a72356fd0f77507f5",
      "text": "直到德尔雷海滩，他才又连续赢球，打进四强。接下来的阿卡普尔科，这一次，他把奖杯带走了。",
      "audio_sha256": "2095f64a13389f317559693c3004a9a8b18786e18afb71e6373d1d7980d9c612",
      "marks_sha256": "90aed1741e464144cd508f4f3cbe272e9939ca1c78bc7fc45bca0eca5a1729f7"
    },
    {
      "id": "527be1915cf5459018b0ce02b789b8e0215033ac30a809449ae86ba7ef718bd4",
      "text": "美网首轮，两盘落后，他连扳三盘击败科梅萨尼亚。第二轮再逆转斯库尔凯特，第三轮输给布洛克斯。",
      "audio_sha256": "bd0d3be869b35fbcf1c7da88e76551402d575ff592a0548f611d82293b7391d8",
      "marks_sha256": "a0e61962986b97e862aaf2b2d446718b1794e91ee81a691b1ba7637aa80e5e16"
    },
    {
      "id": "55c34c16cdbbbc48f2111bc820fa9ec069443fde13e07cc53775bf6fc51f8f61",
      "text": "北京和上海，他又连续输掉首战。赛季最后的室内硬帝，能否拿到门票，依然没有答案。",
      "audio_sha256": "30dcaf858614e4ed8ce3b3e85523b01aedb752d6e6948f13c48f0e1d704fbe12",
      "marks_sha256": "df03a59359e428362681c2ef8018290124876b617ec29bfb25cdf42aefffdc60"
    },
    {
      "id": "581e2ea32f66e5b96416674859ba26f2e17fe033a5a065416173d8b745fb1cfb",
      "text": "马德里击败梅德韦杰夫，打进八强。罗马第三轮、汉堡首轮出局之后，他带着起伏来到巴黎。",
      "audio_sha256": "11081c89b3eb573d1ac8161920ab5e173580608b23a6f43d251d2ca2edbde627",
      "marks_sha256": "dc4f7ec27909c7ddca7a1b56de3d7fd16b6cf2fff8515a7fdfac70344b8800d8"
    },
    {
      "id": "64d2d0fbf47d3f0416dd180fa935b3f4f4e33085e3382c643ea6df154fb28b4a",
      "text": "印第安维尔斯第三轮，迈阿密首战失利，蒙特卡洛第二轮。三月到四月，成绩仍有起伏。",
      "audio_sha256": "d92800255c1803bb3cd0812a79bdb8801a1fa7d2619ae1148d8738a5d9ec00ad",
      "marks_sha256": "b3d9cf65761af6fb81bc7e48af3f65da423e9b0c693d61c928891e9344e65d1d"
    },
    {
      "id": "69922ac3516c829b09741959e0a65c17af2912e4328dbfc8c448ea849c87a230",
      "text": "来到里昂，他在半决赛拿到四个赛点，却还是输给穆塞蒂。错过的机会，让这段冲刺多了一层波折。",
      "audio_sha256": "af60a9ea61c0eec2b78e1a3b8e2f74e5df44a2b7c46be76360c58b386ac663d9",
      "marks_sha256": "789f3df6daea7722865835a7cc37fcb4d72c610bde1a5a823fe6b84be8c8b341"
    },
    {
      "id": "78b12b634a7b6a184d6099e29fd0bd23c96a8825dba7444e651a7e51d976b69e",
      "text": "哈雷首轮出局，温网又打进八强。第四轮三盘淘汰德米纳尔，四分之一决赛输给费里，连续第二年停在这里。",
      "audio_sha256": "3d5cc2130ca3aae02780e085bf20eb79d4780ba7aee78b9a9625efbca4c93bbe",
      "marks_sha256": "5bb5e15d59aa42d8502a137160360c0fa0e26441cd20c2454835aa7603dd89e7"
    },
    {
      "id": "863e11300d0687d083d938fdfad4a00f20dd503ae548cf629ab60781b3b71eb9",
      "text": "维也纳第二轮，面对贝雷蒂尼，他在首盘二比五时伤退。随后退出巴黎，自己已经无法再上场争取积分。",
      "audio_sha256": "85a08e5cdeb504dbcf7900f7e382239ab6e2727f2d47ed81cdc22dc72bf67439",
      "marks_sha256": "0d1f2e110f8f173c25b7b9a7d8730a851dc15043e1dac3cdc071178fe2fcc9c6"
    },
    {
      "id": "878822f0a3c45d06c25712c5b5abdb6c9a66bbe5de0294e87433c7059361d35f",
      "text": "四月的慕尼黑，他在半决赛六比三、六比三击败兹维列夫。决赛输给谢尔顿，也拿到了三百三十分。",
      "audio_sha256": "7d22aa26192b49e2f3a84d3b3edb74f7f0ec09cb178d816c9cb04d3d896b2971",
      "marks_sha256": "ff84193e2c5d4f650312ba855bcca3d9262997b61181145d6dad3d5fa29ae9aa"
    },
    {
      "id": "8b70b99863d748c8e9d7db0a378fe1b0bc208964502215bbdb53686305fbeb91",
      "text": "四分之一决赛逆转保罗，半决赛输给菲斯。四百分到手，科博利继续向第一次年终总决赛靠近。",
      "audio_sha256": "04fda7fc7e06039dbe50f2d60f39a46e524d0ea5ef873db5918642682d575a5d",
      "marks_sha256": "990b961086cfe7c7ee8db3f21ea7bd52d13f9321bcc995a150ec08c65975b589"
    },
    {
      "id": "a3b8c7e2a0cc3488f1758aefe76e770ac91937c676de3d622b4993e4dbb60581",
      "text": "从联合杯到澳网，再到蒙彼利埃和达拉斯，四场单打连败。这个赛季，他的开局很难。",
      "audio_sha256": "c134e4390daf25a7a1f1c5f1ecb2c9e8d6b5645b786a3d3a6e18987cf3b47f66",
      "marks_sha256": "dad0193455a036d0bf878b339efa044c1ee1542d5fb78a7f7e7f59cfcfeca8d8"
    },
    {
      "id": "a867cc087ad0e59d3bf9e7bbd63a24dd1ae571c1ada76adab417dc3d5de5fb43",
      "text": "乌马格和加拿大站都没赢球。来到辛辛那提，他连续四场打满三盘，第一次闯进大师赛四强。",
      "audio_sha256": "d8be93f56e2806dd37423eb5887595f496d240cb7eac77a190d1b61743233643",
      "marks_sha256": "0dec5ab0fa921b6180068541edd419c52d14012f6ccaf8eb62bc2f8f826dc422"
    },
    {
      "id": "ab9886b31c2b058ef9b256655bbf412b141dcbe2c7cc1a7a84fd3e33b5e06bd2",
      "text": "决赛七比六、六比四击败蒂亚福，拿下生涯首座硬帝巡回赛冠军。五百分到手，赛季终于有了亮色。",
      "audio_sha256": "99d40edf2418e4afb78af413d3c4481cfca37f73953fe0376e49ebdb2798b4bc",
      "marks_sha256": "be67d97801961bc4ec31fbca51ff96719eb99b0da92b41fc8ffdbee7b0a43858"
    },
    {
      "id": "b80ad40cf03e2a1bf0849f74b5dd89f9591e3dfac6354816bf5cd093c739d31d",
      "text": "关注网球时插，时插归我，好球归你。",
      "audio_sha256": "5e79e5655e47efc2c0d3cee79eaeb80b9ff840b05900c74b39a6b72a62d8d70e",
      "marks_sha256": "ffd92401e4e51d044cd0ba811dd56c27dfa59f0de4734ee872348e09ba3401b8"
    },
    {
      "id": "d9431666a4575b1daffc8bad739325222e4f0be6ca01a532624f9d123e692332",
      "text": "他先连赢五场，打进四强。半决赛阿尔纳尔迪赛前退赛，科博利第一次站上大满贯决赛。",
      "audio_sha256": "467914ed267ee49b0b9a9d3ae881ae9100561f6839ce3346e236e5aadb39bfbf",
      "marks_sha256": "478420eb46ebc5e5702980696ccdb091ab87b29478cbcd80ea64ae6c181249f6"
    },
    {
      "id": "da36673bc447eff873a1f55c987b0fa83af7cc13ed2580e1862f962c518885e8",
      "text": "年初四连败，年末第一次入围总决赛。科博利的这一年，中间隔着多少次重新出发？",
      "audio_sha256": "9f6a780cc78a0f44531da964a252619999eedce14923ab4e79472f7a19ba7633",
      "marks_sha256": "af566588637ed9c73a1de976965e37428a5bdd908a89a7e9fa334f5e672b4d73"
    },
    {
      "id": "df396c71b22c3a2b8e71d51d63ef174039faee02d0a3f4a4eecc415ce4cfcaeb",
      "text": "决赛对面，又是兹维列夫。第四盘抢七，科博利把比赛拖进决胜盘，冠军还没有分出。",
      "audio_sha256": "923064621d0f2f9472f04873195aae942d1926901e6911ae0b279365cee2a5f4",
      "marks_sha256": "c1c0a492830d72d4669a05265b2b23a30d120bb15d207ea10ba1f1e0fe3ddeef"
    },
    {
      "id": "dff7854138e6633f53efc8274e6b7623865965b3e815bb1170e507b1113debc6",
      "text": "十一月三日晚，鲁德在巴黎击败霍达尔。这个结果，让科博利第一次锁定年终总决赛资格。",
      "audio_sha256": "7a21a4319c97696b9f537bc71afea944ce99c390d95ba0160a480a023c9bc6f7",
      "marks_sha256": "0f5f3f66177160de6090b88bba6307d08a2f52e3407fd03f234baccaaea4cf7a"
    }
  ],
  "scope": "Restored actual published V4 input bytes into isolated native content cache; not a new voice approval"
}
